CivicResolve – AI-Assisted Civic Grievance Management System

Project Overview

CivicResolve is a web-based civic grievance management system designed to help citizens report public issues and track their complaints efficiently.

Problem Statement

Traditional civic complaint systems often involve delays, limited transparency, and difficulties in tracking complaint status.

Proposed Solution

CivicResolve provides a centralized platform for registering civic complaints, tracking their progress, and helping authorities manage and prioritize reported issues.

Key Features

- Citizen complaint registration
- Issue category selection
- Location-based complaint reporting
- Complaint status tracking
- Authority dashboard
- AI-assisted complaint classification and prioritization

Technology Stack

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

Expected Outcome

To improve communication between citizens and authorities through a simple, transparent, and accessible digital grievance management platform.

Project Type

Prototype – Web Application